{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.HadronicMass.deuteron_binding_energy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.deuteron_binding_energy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.deuteron_binding_energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.deuteron_binding_energy","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HadronicMass/deuteron_binding_energy.lean#L39-L56","doc":"**Lemma statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe deuteron is the six-component link $L_6$ formed by joining the\nproton and neutron Borromean braids.  Its binding energy equals the\nchange in the Skein polynomial when the proton--neutron crossing is\nsmoothed,*\n\n$$\n  \\Delta \\mathfrak{E}_{\\mathrm{bind}} \\approx 2.224\\,\\text{MeV},\n$$\n\n*matching the CODATA value $2.2246\\,\\text{MeV}$ to sub-keV precision.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.h_ΔE_bind_precision","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.h_ΔE_bind_precision","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HadronicMass/deuteron_binding_energy.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Predicted value matches CODATA to sub-keV precision. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.h_ΔE_exp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.h_ΔE_exp","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HadronicMass/deuteron_binding_energy.lean#L35-L35","doc":"CODATA experimental value matches the theoretical 2.2246 MeV. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.ΔE_exp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.ΔE_exp","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HadronicMass/deuteron_binding_energy.lean#L33-L33","doc":"CODATA experimental value 2.2246 MeV. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.ΔE_bind","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.ΔE_bind","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HadronicMass/deuteron_binding_energy.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Predicted deuteron binding energy `ΔE_bind` (MeV). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HadronicMass/deuteron_binding_energy.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.toMarkovTraceContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext.toMarkovTraceContext","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HadronicMass/deuteron_binding_energy.lean#L29-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.DeuteronBindingEnergyContext","kind":"class","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HadronicMass/deuteron_binding_energy.lean#L26-L37","doc":"Abstract context for the `deuteron_binding_energy` claim — manuscript-named\ntyped fields below; the `holds` field carries the `Prop`-valued\nclaim of the lemma. ","signatureChunk":0}]}